Script to project future fire risk due to heatwaves:
  extd_fig9.m

To run the script smoothly, you'll additionally need two files that were stored on Zenodo:
  --CESM_LENS2_region_heatwave_proportion.zip (each ensemble member's projected change in the proportion of heatwave events)
  --CESM_LENS2__region_heatwave_proportion_7d_duration.zip (each ensemble member's projected change in the proportion of heatwave events, with more details for days 1 - 7 after the heatwaves start)
